# Build output
#
# `pnpm lint` is `prettier --check .`, and CI now fails on it rather than
# silently rewriting files. Prettier does not read .gitignore, so anything a
# build emits is checked unless it is listed here — which made the lint job's
# result depend on whether a build had run in the same workspace first. None of
# these are authored, so none of them should be able to fail formatting.
.next/
.svelte-kit/
.source/
.turbo/
dist/
build/
# Regenerated by `next dev`/`next build` on every run.
next-env.d.ts

